      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Posterize cuts a picture's smooth tones into a few flat Levels, like a screen print. Dither scatters the edges between bands in a Pattern, here a Bayer grid at Scale 4. Turn Levels from 2 to 12, raise Dither, and try the other Patterns."
        }
